  "priorExpiration": "1997-10-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 901.05 Reuse Requirements and Limitations.\n\n(a) Asbestos waste shall not be reused.\n\n(b) Reuse of containers used for storage or transportation of asbestos waste shall comply with Env-Sw 901.06 (d) through (f).\n\nSource. #5172, eff 7-1-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 900); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2601.05); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14067, eff 9-3-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw900.html"
